    "detailed_description": "In the near Future, a mysterious plague spread, trapping people in <strong>endless nightmares</strong> from which they could not wake.<br><br><strong>The Dreamers</strong> are a rare group of individuals, gifted with a power called the <strong>Dreamers Foresight</strong>, allowed them to enter the dream realm.<br><br><strong>Liquid memories</strong> allowed Dreamers to enter other peoples nightmares , But once inside, Dreamers must find and <strong>destroy the core of the nightmare</strong>. Only then can the dreamer wake.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your world</h2>Build As you explore the Dream realm, Find &amp; collect biome Tiles. Strategically align similar tiles to earn better loot.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954750/extras/fce112f6a1fe4994bb89cab1591c805f.poster.avif?t=1754988839\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954750/extras/fce112f6a1fe4994bb89cab1591c805f.webm?t=1754988839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954750/extras/fce112f6a1fe4994bb89cab1591c805f.mp4?t=1754988839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Deck Building</h2>Build your deck with variety set of cards. Pick cards that work together to defeat nightmare creatures.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954750/extras/da6d91886acbd90125d5a1576751dd4e.poster.avif?t=1754988839\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954750/extras/da6d91886acbd90125d5a1576751dd4e.webm?t=1754988839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954750/extras/da6d91886acbd90125d5a1576751dd4e.mp4?t=1754988839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging Combat</h2>Battle nightmare creatures each with unique abilities, while balancing your energy between attack and defense.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954750/extras/f8fc685e76da7bd639a23b3b749eaec8.poster.avif?t=1754988839\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954750/extras/f8fc685e76da7bd639a23b3b749eaec8.webm?t=1754988839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954750/extras/f8fc685e76da7bd639a23b3b749eaec8.mp4?t=1754988839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The Game still a sandbox for your ideas, share your ideas in Discord",
    "about_the_game": "In the near Future, a mysterious plague spread, trapping people in <strong>endless nightmares</strong> from which they could not wake.<br><br><strong>The Dreamers</strong> are a rare group of individuals, gifted with a power called the <strong>Dreamers Foresight</strong>, allowed them to enter the dream realm.<br><br><strong>Liquid memories</strong> allowed Dreamers to enter other peoples nightmares , But once inside, Dreamers must find and <strong>destroy the core of the nightmare</strong>. Only then can the dreamer wake.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your world</h2>Build As you explore the Dream realm, Find &amp; collect biome Tiles. Strategically align similar tiles to earn better loot.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954750/extras/fce112f6a1fe4994bb89cab1591c805f.poster.avif?t=1754988839\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954750/extras/fce112f6a1fe4994bb89cab1591c805f.webm?t=1754988839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954750/extras/fce112f6a1fe4994bb89cab1591c805f.mp4?t=1754988839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Deck Building</h2>Build your deck with variety set of cards. Pick cards that work together to defeat nightmare creatures.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954750/extras/da6d91886acbd90125d5a1576751dd4e.poster.avif?t=1754988839\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954750/extras/da6d91886acbd90125d5a1576751dd4e.webm?t=1754988839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954750/extras/da6d91886acbd90125d5a1576751dd4e.mp4?t=1754988839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging Combat</h2>Battle nightmare creatures each with unique abilities, while balancing your energy between attack and defense.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954750/extras/f8fc685e76da7bd639a23b3b749eaec8.poster.avif?t=1754988839\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954750/extras/f8fc685e76da7bd639a23b3b749eaec8.webm?t=1754988839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954750/extras/f8fc685e76da7bd639a23b3b749eaec8.mp4?t=1754988839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The Game still a sandbox for your ideas, share your ideas in Discord",
